Setup:

1. Install Python
Download and install Python from:
https://www.python.org
Make sure Python is added to system PATH.

2. Clone the Repository
Copy code
Bash
git clone <your-github-repo-link>
cd Automated-Podcast-Transcription

3. Install Required Libraries
Copy code
Bash
python -m pip install streamlit matplotlib pandas wordcloud nltk librosa

4. Download NLTK Data
Open Python terminal and run:
Copy code
Python
import nltk
nltk.download('punkt')
nltk.download('stopwords')

5. Run the Application
Copy code
Bash
streamlit run ui/app.py
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

 Usage:

Launch the web application.
Select a transcript file from the dropdown.
View transcription text.
Play cleaned audio.
View segmented text.
Check extracted keywords.
Search for keywords.
View word frequency chart and word cloud.
