 Troubleshooting:

Problem
Solution
pip not recognized
Use python -m pip install
Missing library error
Reinstall the library
Streamlit not opening
Check Python PATH
Audio not loading
Check file path
Visualization not showing
Ensure matplotlib installed
Permission error
Run terminal as administrator
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

 Limitations and Challenges:

Accuracy depends on audio quality.
Background noise affects transcription.
Large audio files increase processing time.
Topic segmentation is rule-based.
Real-time processing not supported.
Language support is limited.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
